AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill changes the law to enable local governing bodies to issue warrants for civil forfeiture of
an unlicensed dog for nonpayment of dog license fees. The law currently requires local governing
bodiestoissuewarrantsforcivilforfeitureofanunlicenseddogfornonpaymentofdoglicensefees.
